{"comment_text": {"ja48:0.1": "", "ja48:0.2": "", "ja48:0.3": "", "ja48:0.4": "", "ja48:1.1": "The commentary says that a brahmin named Vedabbha, being captured by bandits from Cetī, paid his ransom through a wealth-granting spell also named Vedabbha. But that only inflames the bandits’ desires, and they end up killing him and each other. Despite the commentary, however, the verse does not mention bandits, spells, or brahmins. ", "ja48:1.2": "", "ja48:1.3": "Vedabbha (Sanskrit <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vaidarbha</i>) is a name for the king of Vidarbha, a country to the south of Cetī. It seems the original story concerned a raid by the Cetans that resulted in the death of the king of Vidarbha, a framework that could well convey the same moral. ", "ja48:1.4": "", "ja48:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja48:0.1": "<article id='ja48'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja48:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja48:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja48:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja48:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja48:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja48:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja48:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja48:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja48:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja48:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja48:0.3": "Atthakāmavagga ", "ja48:0.4": "8. Vedabbajātaka ", "ja48:1.1": "“Anupāyena yo atthaṁ, ", "ja48:1.2": "Icchati so vihaññati; ", "ja48:1.3": "Cetā haniṁsu vedabbaṁ, ", "ja48:1.4": "Sabbe te byasanamajjhagūti. ", "ja48:2.1": "Vedabbajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja48:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 48 ", "ja48:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja48:0.3": "Wanting to Help ", "ja48:0.4": "About Vedabbha: a past life story ", "ja48:1.1": "Who wishes to profit by inappropriate means ", "ja48:1.2": "is tormented. ", "ja48:1.3": "The Cetans who killed Vedabbha ", "ja48:1.4": "all fell into ruin. ", "ja48:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja48:0.1": "", "ja48:0.2": "", "ja48:0.3": "", "ja48:0.4": "", "ja48:1.1": "", "ja48:1.2": "", "ja48:1.3": "vedabbaṁ → vedabbhaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja48:1.4": "byasanamajjhagūti → byasanamajjhagunti (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja48:2.1": "Vedabbajātakaṁ → vedabbhajātakaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja48:0.1": "", "ja48:0.2": "", "ja48:0.3": "", "ja48:0.4": "", "ja48:1.1": "dr27.17, ms22J_104, msdiv48, pts-vp-pli1.256, sya27.16", "ja48:1.2": "", "ja48:1.3": "", "ja48:1.4": "", "ja48:2.1": "ms22J_105"}, "keys_order": ["ja48:0.1", "ja48:0.2", "ja48:0.3", "ja48:0.4", "ja48:1.1", "ja48:1.2", "ja48:1.3", "ja48:1.4", "ja48:2.1"]}